Problem: Create a pod named httpd-pod with resource requests (Memory: 15Mi, CPU: 100m) and limits (Memory: 20Mi, CPU: 100m).

Solution:

httpd-pod.yaml:

yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: httpd-pod
spec:
  containers:
    - name: httpd-container
      image: httpd:latest
      resources:
        requests:
          memory: "15Mi"
          cpu: "100m"
        limits:
          memory: "20Mi"
          cpu: "100m"
      ports:
        - containerPort: 80
bash
kubectl apply -f httpd-pod.yaml
kubectl describe pod httpd-pod | grep -A 5 "Limits"
